{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RAWThp4UZj1793616229.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產大埔昌運中心高級資深分區營業經理招權峰表示，近期市況向好，帶動交投，大埔翠屏花園最新錄B座高層08室，單位實用面積269平方呎，1房間隔，日前議價後以343.8萬元沽出，平均實用呎價約12,781元。</p><p> </p><p>據了解，新買家為投資客，見單位價錢合理，即決定購入單位投資收租，單位市值月租約13,500元，買家料可享約4.7厘租金回報。據了解，原業主於2016年以293萬元購入上址，持貨約10年，現轉手賬面獲利50.8萬元離場，單位期內升值17.3%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:42:48.988723+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.201722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:00.950234+00:00","content_hash":"fe3fdf094169159a3d971ea0292c6d09dae98cff7323a6ae82ebfc403acbc3f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:42:48.988723+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}